{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":66,"timestamp":"2026-07-14T04:40:27.457006949Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"a3a1ba6a-d821-4cbe-a8bf-ca8e01a81b47","title":"Audit-violations and override-audit reporting (Phase 5)","description":"## Phase 5 — Reporting Commands\n\nAdd CLI commands to view enforcement status and audit trail.\n\n## What to do\n\n1. crosslink status --audit-violations: show all enforcement failures\n2. crosslink status --override-audit: show all emergency overrides with driver identity + timestamp\n3. Optionally: crosslink status --enforcement-summary: show current signing_enforcement mode + bootstrap.status\n\n## Depends on\n- Issue #22 (enforcement wiring must exist to generate violations/overrides)\n- Issue #23 (event-sig verification must exist to generate event-level violations)\n\n## Source\nto-file/crosslink-gates/gates-issues.md Phase 5\nevidence-based-gates.md §7 Q5","priority":"low","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDlcZn7d9s08PYQzmBC956zyQlwcU7dkfz4DkdeItHdG1D5Oe7GZRDV2HEAhSyFIBJcg21fpkW9gcU2vgh+PWAI="}
